@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@
+# Cloudflare Agents runtime
+
+Deployment configuration must bind each registered agent class (`SupportAgent`, `StepSupportAgent`, and `DelegatingSupportAgent`) to a Cloudflare Durable Object namespace and export those classes from the Worker entrypoint. Add each class to a SQLite Durable Object migration before routing traffic to it.
+
+The deployment owner must configure the provider binding or credentials required by the agents' model selection, deploy the Worker and its migration, and verify namespace bindings, secrets, routes, and rollback behavior. Binding names, migration tags, provider secret names, and release configuration remain deployment-owned because this repository does not establish them.
